MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Tutorial_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0ded921c495564e4396ea127f3f166c8, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 5392725700378625
    m_Localized: Tap a glowing cell to move your fleet there and start a battle with
      the enemy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5392725700378626
    m_Localized: Confirm the move command.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26653119160909825
    m_Localized: Press the Start Battle button to engage the enemy fleet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26653119160909827
    m_Localized: Keep moving through the grid to find the cell where you can escape
      this zone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26917950338236416
    m_Localized: Let's check your Fleet. Open the fleet management screen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26917950392762368
    m_Localized: Command Power lets you deploy more or stronger ships. Tap here to
      increase it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26917950392762369
    m_Localized: Select the All button to use all your Exploration Points.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26917950392762370
    m_Localized: Press Confirm to convert your Exploration Points into Command Power.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26917950392762371
    m_Localized: Command Power increased! Come back anytime you have spare Exploration
      Points.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28403527231340544
    m_Localized: Tap here to open the hull selection list.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28403527231340545
    m_Localized: Locked hulls can be unlocked with Achievement Points. Press the
      Unlock button on a locked hull to use it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28403527231340546
    m_Localized: Your Commander Level rose and you can now deploy another ship! Open
      the fleet management screen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28403527231340547
    m_Localized: Tap the newly opened empty slot to add a ship.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28403527231340548
    m_Localized: Choose the hull you want to deploy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28403527231340549
    m_Localized: Press Confirm to deploy the ship.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28403527231340550
    m_Localized: Ship added! The higher your Commander Level, the more ships you
      can deploy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28414612789395456
    m_Localized: Press Confirm to spend Achievement Points and unlock the hull.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28430607918694400
    m_Localized: Not enough Command Power to deploy this ship. Convert Exploration
      Points into Command Power first, then try again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48467487145984000
    m_Localized: You can deploy up to 9 ships in your fleet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48467487208898560
    m_Localized: Deploying ships requires Command Power. Command Power rises as your
      Commander levels up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48491535926165504
    m_Localized: To swap ships, first unequip the deployed one. Press the Remove
      button.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48491535989080064
    m_Localized: Press Confirm to remove the ship from this slot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48491535989080065
    m_Localized: Tap the empty slot to open the hull selection list again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48491535989080066
    m_Localized: The hull you just unlocked is selected. Press the Place button to
      deploy it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48491535989080067
    m_Localized: New ship deployed! Collect more Achievement Points to unlock stronger
      hulls.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48491535989080068
    m_Localized: You have enough Achievement Points to reinforce a module! Tap the
      manage button of this ship.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48491535989080069
    m_Localized: Tap the manage button of this item to open its reinforcement.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48491535989080070
    m_Localized: Press Reinforce to raise its level using Achievement Points.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48491535989080071
    m_Localized: Press Confirm to spend the Achievement Points.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48491535989080072
    m_Localized: Reinforced! The new level is applied right away. Press Close.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48491535989080073
    m_Localized: Reinforcement is permanent for this hull type. Keep collecting Achievement
      Points to make your ships stronger.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48491535989080074
    m_Localized: These are your PVP opponents. Pick one to battle, and win to gain
      score. A minimum Commander Level is required to fight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48491535989080075
    m_Localized: Your score, rank and the current season are shown here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48491535989080076
    m_Localized: No opponent you like? Refresh the list. Refreshes are limited per
      day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48491535989080077
    m_Localized: Tap the Ranking tab.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48491535989080078
    m_Localized: Switch between PVP and Zone rankings to see how other commanders
      are doing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48492889763610627
    m_Localized: You can abandon an exploration in progress here. Abandoning gives
      no Commander EXP, and your remaining Minerals are lost.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48492889767804928
    m_Localized: Find the escape point and leave the zone to earn your reward.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48492889767804929
    m_Localized: Toggle tactics for Beam, Missile, Hangar, Repair, Shield and Interceptor.
      Active tactics spend resources during battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48501020866510848
    m_Localized: These are the Minerals you gained from the battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48501020929425408
    m_Localized: Spend Minerals to buy a Reward Card. Its bonus lasts for this exploration
      run, and buying the same effect again stacks it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48501020929425409
    m_Localized: Don't like these cards? Reroll to draw new ones. Rerolls are limited.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48501020929425410
    m_Localized: When you are done buying, press Close to continue.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48502460200648704
    m_Localized: Tap Buy Card anytime to spend your Minerals on a Reward Card.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48507305666150400
    m_Localized: Tap Buy Card to spend your Minerals on a Reward Card.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
